title: The glossary, where a stranger looks up a word, opens on the history of three plans of a rewrite.
pid: fccbcb34-6d49-4561-b21a-bc35281de3ba
body: |2-
  "A term marked 'a term of plan 06' ..." is history (Jeff's rule
  that a page says what a thing is, not how its word arose).
  Change: move that paragraph to "Terms of the implementation".
